{"parse": {"title": "以骑士之名-03", "pageid": 127813, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%A5%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8D-02\" title=\"以骑士之名-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">以骑士之名-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BB%A5%E9%AA%91%E5%A3%AB%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8D-04\" title=\"以骑士之名-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">以骑士之名</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.AC.AC.E4.B8.80.E5.A0.82.E8.AF.BE\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"第一堂课\">第一堂课</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 第一堂课</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The First Lesson</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item selected\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法前</div></div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\" style=\"padding:8px 4px; margin-bottom:-8px;\"><div class=\"episode-nav-item episode-nav-battle\"><i class=\"selected-icon\"><img alt=\"选中\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/20px-Img_xuanzhong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"选中\" width=\"20\" height=\"19\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/30px-Img_xuanzhong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f9/Img_xuanzhong.png/40px-Img_xuanzhong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"46\" /></i>玩法后</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"1\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_14\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱一时无言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她观察着阿德海德的神情。后者注视着她，带着审视和浅淡的疏远。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……我不否认身上带着基金会的任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>你依旧坦诚，这一点很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>是，我不希望有任何隐瞒或欺骗让骑士之间彼此疏离。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>但……这并不矛盾，不是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>阿德海德，我是你抚养长大的，而骑士团给了我容身之所和人生目标。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我的确关心着你和骑士团的安危。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>谨慎为她挑选了温和的话语，但真诚的底色是骗不了人的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>初冬的风刮了起来，窗玻璃在凛冽与缄默中震颤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>重塑之手的车队将在两天后途经雷约瓦镇，带着他们曾从城堡里掠夺的财物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>作为代理大团长，当初没能阻止重塑之手的劫掠，那么现在，就必须截下他们的车队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>玛尔纱，我不会坐以待毙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>但重塑之手配备了经神秘术改良的武器，一个人太危险了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>这件事也许可以与基金会合作，那样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>“危险”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德咀嚼着这一词语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>重塑之手刺杀骑士的领袖，肆意闯入我们的领地，将骑士的尊严踩在脚下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>这才是对骑士而言最危险的境遇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>而骑士团，也没有脆弱到需要依靠官僚组织来为我们讨回公道的程度！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德的话掷地有声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她绷紧了面孔，仅对骑士团成员“玛尔纱”展露的和蔼隐藏了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>现在，她所对话的是来自圣洛夫基金会的“玛尔纱”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……抱歉，我不该在这时候提起这个话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她迎上阿德海德冷肃的眼神，窗外苍白的阳光在阿德海德面上切割出浓重的阴影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱意识到了什么。她伸出手，握住阿德海德攥紧的拳头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>玛尔纱，你……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>从交握的双手处，愤懑、悲伤与失望，源源不断地转移至年轻的骑士身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德心里一轻，无可排解的情绪有了另一只手为她牢牢托着。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item tabber\" data-type=\"index\" data-index=\"2\"><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-s01_bg_14.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"s01_bg_14\"><img alt=\"s01_bg_14\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/600px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/900px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e7/Cg-s01_bg_14.png/1200px-Cg-s01_bg_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你……承担了太多，阿德海德，我能感知到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我始终是骑士团的成员。互相照料，彼此分担，我没有忘记过骑士团的教导。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德神情复杂。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>那你也不该忘记，吸收他人的感知，将会对你的身体造成极重的负担。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>不到危难时刻，不该轻易去做这件事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱笑了笑，怀着些许愧疚和更多亲近。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>你告诉过我，为同伴分担痛苦也是骑士的职责。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>所以，请让我和你一起去拦截车队吧。两个人成功的可能性一定更大。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>还是说，你觉得我能抛下你转头就走吗，阿德海德修士？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>……就算我不答应，你也一定会跟上来吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱无言看着阿德海德。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>好吧。明天天一亮，我们就出发。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_xifenghaiya\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_xifenghaiya\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_xifenghaiya.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海浪拍击着礁岩，层层叠叠的浪潮吞没了细微的呜咽。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>你果然在这儿，玛尔纱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年幼的孩童抬起头，云层在她的泪水里迁徙。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>那些侍从又欺负你了，是吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她胡乱抹去面上的痕迹，有些赧然地点头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>……我该怎么办呢，阿德海德？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德坐在她身边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531804.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531804.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>你想怎么做，玛尔纱？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>我已经尽量地躲远了，可他们——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531805.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531805.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>宽厚的手拍在孩童的脑袋上，她迷茫地望向自己的抚养者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531805.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531805.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>他们欺负你，是为了确认，面对你他们该如何行事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531805.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531805.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>与啃食弱者的鬣狗对峙时，你不该胆怯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>那我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531805.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531805.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-531805.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531805.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>下次他们再欺负你，你要打回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>可是，他们长得比我高，力气比我大……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>认真训练，你就能获得力量，好好吃饭，你也会长高。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>重要的是，得让所有人知道，你不会事事逆来顺受。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>就算失败了也没关系，但是你得展现出重要的品格——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2b/HeadIconSmall-531801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>你有敢于以弱胜强的勇气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531802.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-531802.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531802.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531802.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-531802.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531802.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/HeadIconSmall-531802.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531802.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>一位合格的骑士，可不能只会坐在这里哭鼻子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德海德拍拍玛尔纱的肩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>是的，我要成为一名勇敢的骑士……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>孩童懵懂地复述。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海浪又一次拍击着礁石，仿如盔甲撞击时的嗡鸣。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱睁开眼。昏暗的室内，零星可见骑士肩上一点银光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"531804.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"531804.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e8/HeadIconSmall-531804.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-531804.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德海德：</div><div>看来不需要我叫醒你了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>窗前，阿德海德收拾着行囊，斯塔希那块做工稚拙的盾牌被她系在腰间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛尔纱长长呼出一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"312701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"312701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/HeadIconSmall-312701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-312701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛尔纱：</div><div>稍等，阿德海德，我马上就收拾好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>片刻之后，玛尔纱提上医疗箱，与阿德海德一同出了门。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye\"><img alt=\"3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png/600px-Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png/900px-Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a1/Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png/1200px-Cg-3_1_bg_xiaowu_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "以骑士之名-03"}}